{
  "key": 20263,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "msg_0556_T22_00000",
      "en_US": [
        "Hello, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}? We discovered\n",
        "something about the Egg!\r",
        "My assistant is at the Pokémon Center\n",
        "in Violet City.\f",
        "Could you talk to him?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0556_T22_00001",
      "en_US": [
        "Bonjour!\n",
        "You are Trainer?\r",
        "Battle Gym Leader, win you did? {YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0556_T22_00002",
      "en_US": [
        "Ooh, la la!\n",
        "Very indeed nice!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0556_T22_00003",
      "en_US": [
        "Is that so? Then study shall you!\f",
        "Follow me!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0556_T22_00004",
      "en_US": [
        "Here, teacher I am.\n",
        "Good it is you study here!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0556_T22_00005",
      "en_US": [
        "There have been reports of Ghost-type\n",
        "Pokémon appearing in Sprout Tower.\r",
        "They say Normal-type Pokémon moves\n",
        "have no effect on them."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0556_T22_00006",
      "en_US": [
        "Hey, you’re a Pokémon Trainer?\r",
        "If you beat the Gym Leader here,\n",
        "you’ll be ready for prime time!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0556_T22_00007",
      "en_US": [
        "Falkner, from the Violet City Pokémon\n",
        "Gym, is a fine Trainer!\r",
        "He inherited his father’s Gym and\n",
        "has done a great job with it."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0556_T22_00008",
      "en_US": [
        "You cannot have your Pokémon out\n",
        "walking with you in some places.\r",
        "Places like buildings, caves, and\n",
        "where there are huge crowds.\r",
        "But all you have to do is to put it in\n",
        "a Poké Ball!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0556_T22_00009",
      "en_US": [
        "Violet City\n",
        "The City of Nostalgic Scents"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0556_T22_00010",
      "en_US": [
        "Violet City Pokémon Gym\n",
        "Leader: Falkner\f",
        "The Elegant Master of Flying Pokémon"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0556_T22_00011",
      "en_US": [
        "Sprout Tower\r",
        "Experience the Way of Pokémon\n",
        "to Cast Aside Your Doubts."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0556_T22_00012",
      "en_US": [
        "Pokémon School\r",
        "Earl will show you all\n",
        "there is to Pokémon!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0556_T22_00013",
      "en_US": [
        "Me oh my...\n",
        "That Egg must be...!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0556_T22_00014",
      "en_US": [
        "I see...\n",
        "So it was handed from Mr. Pokémon to\f",
        "Professor Elm, then from Professor Elm\f",
        "to you.\r",
        "Now I get it...\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0556_T22_00015",
      "en_US": [
        "That Egg is truly an important Egg.\n",
        "Please do take good care of it for me.\r",
        "Is that understood?\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0556_T22_00016",
      "en_US": "I am counting on you.\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0556_T22_00017",
      "en_US": [
        "Shard de Berry!\n",
        "Shard de Berry!\r",
        "Yah, yah!\n",
        "I trade Berry for a Shard.\r",
        "If ya bring me some Shards,\n",
        "I will give ya three Berries, yah.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0556_T22_00018",
      "en_US": [
        "Shard de Berry!\n",
        "Shard de Berry!\r",
        "Yah, yah!\n",
        "I trade Berry for Shard.\r",
        "If ya bring me some Shards,\n",
        "I will give ya three Berries, yah.\r",
        "Which Shard will ya trade for\n",
        "de Berry? {YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0556_T22_00019",
      "en_US": [
        "More Shards to trade for\n",
        "de Berries? {YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0556_T22_00020",
      "en_US": [
        "Yah, yah!\n",
        "Come back when ya’ve changed\f",
        "ya mind, yah.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0556_T22_00021",
      "en_US": [
        "I’ll give ya de Berry set A\n",
        "for de Red Shard, yah.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0556_T22_00022",
      "en_US": [
        "I’ll give ya de Berry set B\n",
        "for de Blue Shard, yah.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0556_T22_00023",
      "en_US": [
        "I’ll give ya de Berry set C\n",
        "for de Yellow Shard, yah.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0556_T22_00024",
      "en_US": [
        "I’ll give ya de Berry set D\n",
        "for de Green Shard, yah.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0556_T22_00025",
      "en_US": [
        "Ya already have many Berries\n",
        "of dis set.\r",
        "Come back when ya need more, yah.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0556_T22_00026",
      "en_US": [
        "We care about the traditional buildings\n",
        "around here. That’s why even the\f",
        "Poké Mart and Pokémon Center are\f",
        "painted a bit somberly to blend in."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0556_T22_00027",
      "en_US": [
        "Did you know that Pokégear allows you\n",
        "to put marks and memos on its Map?\r",
        "I’d love to have one of those\n",
        "Pokégears, but my mom won’t let me."
      ]
    }
  ]
}
